    }
  ],
  "explanation": "Execution begins with the Initial Strategy Builder drafting the full market-entry plan. The Gulf Expert Reviewer then audits the draft for regional accuracy and regulatory correctness. The JV Strategy Refiner incorporates this expert feedback into an improved strategy. Next, the Completeness Validator assesses the refined output; if it outputs 'retry', the pipeline loops back to the JV Strategy Refiner for up to 3 iterations until quality is met. Once 'pass' is returned, the Executive Polisher formats the final document for delivery."
